stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> LISTEN
  LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD: SYN / send SYN-ACK
  SYN_RCVD --> SYN_RCVD: duplicate SYN / resend SYN-ACK
  SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED: ACK or first DATA
  ESTABLISHED --> ESTABLISHED: DATA / ACK
  ESTABLISHED --> TIME_WAIT: FIN / verify SHA-256, send FIN-ACK
  TIME_WAIT --> TIME_WAIT: repeated FIN / resend FIN-ACK
  TIME_WAIT --> CLOSED: linger timer expires
  SYN_RCVD --> ABORTED: idle 30 s / send RST
  ESTABLISHED --> ABORTED: idle 30 s / send RST, keep .incomplete
  CLOSED --> [*]
  ABORTED --> [*]
